"mid-endgame-06":{"title":"Endgame · Win material 3","difficultyLabel":"Intermediate · estimated difficulty","goal":"Red to move. Win material in 4 moves.","nodes.n0.choices[0].reason":"The Chariot on file 2 advances to take Black's Cannon on file 8 on the back rank and checks the General along the rank. Black must retreat an Advisor to block.","nodes.n0.watchOut":"If Black plays R7-6 (the Chariot comes back to block), R2=3 takes the Chariot with check and Red mates a few moves later.","nodes.n1.choices[0].reason":"The key move: the Chariot retreats all the way to Red's own back rank to defend. The Red General is on the third rank and very exposed to a string of Black Chariot checks; with the Chariot on the back rank, the General and the Cannon on file 3 are safe.","nodes.n1.watchOut":"If the Chariot does not retreat far enough (for example R2-2), Black gets counterplay and the game is level.","nodes.n2.choices[0].reason":"The Black Chariot checks along the central file; the Red General steps to file 6 out of check.","nodes.n2.watchOut":"Whether Black takes the Soldier on file 5 (R5-3) or keeps checking (R5=4), Red keeps the extra material.","nodes.n3.choices[0].reason":"The Cannon on file 3 advances to Black's back rank and checks with an Advisor as its screen, winning a tempo to steady the position. Red is a Cannon up with a winning endgame.","nodes.n3.watchOut":"Do not attack with R2+6: Black counterattacks and Red gets checkmated.","source":"Pikafish self-play game (checked at 800k nodes per move)","verification":"Solution reviewed by the author and compared with Pikafish outside the app; the app checks the rules and the material at the end of the line; not reviewed by an expert.","assessment":"Material: a nearly level endgame (Red has a Chariot, a Cannon, 2 Soldiers and 2 Advisors; Black has a Chariot, a Cannon, 2 Soldiers and 2 Advisors). The Red General has moved up to the third rank of the central file, and Black's Chariot on file 7 on the fourth rank in Red's half is pressing close. Red's Chariot on file 2 on the riverbank looks straight up at Black's Cannon on file 8 on the back rank; Red's Soldier on file 5 has reached the fourth rank in Black's half, and Red's Cannon on file 3 is on Red's own back rank.","idea":"Take the Cannon with the Chariot, giving check, then pull the Chariot back to defend before the Black Chariot can check, move the General out of check, and use a Cannon check to steady the position: Red ends a full Cannon up in the endgame.","urgency":"If Red is slow, Black plays C8=6, then checks with the Chariot and takes the Soldier on file 5; the game becomes level or tilts toward Black. The hard part is the second move: right after winning material you must pull back to defend."},
